y":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 the middle went short late, with October to November at 37% and November to December at 47%. The 2026 year so far has run low on the middle too, with February to March at 38% and March to April at 23%. Grid 11888 had its driest year in 1955 at 66%.</p>"}
